Subject: Re: Get individual fitted residual scores
Message-ID: <b10gUyR1TSk.GJIjXNEqDAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <b10gUyR1TSk.Oaog-HPGCwAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
